nt, it could have a big impact. It’s important that you try to understand, and so you have to actively ask questions. Probably, if you do not understand and you say nothing, the speaker will not know that you do not understand. Don’t miss your chance.</ns0:t></ns0:r></ns0:p></ns0:txbxContent></ns4:txbx><ns4:bodyPr rot="0" vert="horz" wrap="square" lIns="108000" tIns="72000" rIns="108000" bIns="72000" anchor="t" anchorCtr="0"><ns3:noAutofit /></ns4:bodyPr></ns4:wsp></ns3:graphicData></ns3:graphic><ns2:sizeRelH relativeFrom="margin"><ns2:pctWidth>0</ns2:pctWidth></ns2:sizeRelH><ns2:sizeRelV relativeFrom="margin"><ns2:pctHeight>0</ns2:pctHeight></ns2:sizeRelV></ns1:anchor></ns0:drawing>